"move0 dt" is an object [role: value, value_kind: input, default: 1.0].

"move0 out" is an object [role: value, datatype: examples.geometry.Pose2D@sha256:123b8c15cda217478b331e2133a5de7c5aafb8075d0ca203e8a7e7e50797cf9b, value_kind: output].

